<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24095" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξῐτερός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>right-hand of two,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. κατὰ μαζόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.393
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. χειρί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					20.197
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποδί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.96
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιτερά</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χείρ</span>), ἡ,
				<i>the right hand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.501
			</span></i>; 
				Ep.
			 dat. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεξιτερῆφι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					24.284
				</span></i>
			; rare in Com., <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				174.6
			</span></i>.</div>
